# Restart — sound-first. NOT a bright buzzy oscillator (every one of
# those read as brass/organ/string). A SOFT core — triangle with a
# sine octave — made electronic by IMPERFECTION, not spectrum: unison 3
# so three cards drift and beat (analog chorus), filter low and static
# so there's no attack sweep and no buzz, a hair of glide. The
# character will come from the tape wow/flutter and reverb in the song,
# the way BoC leads live in their processing, not their waveform.
unison 3
unison_detune 11
waveform 3
osc2_wave 0
osc2_pitch 12
osc2_level 0.3
osc3_wave 0
osc3_pitch 0
osc3_level 0
detune 6
sub 0.1
circuit 0
key_track 0.4
osc_fm 0
sync 0
ring 0
glide 0.02
pulse_width 0.5
attack 0.04
decay 0.5
sustain 0.85
release 0.5
filter_env 0.0
filter_attack 0.1
filter_decay 0.4
filter_sustain 0.6
filter_release 0.4
cutoff 1500
resonance 0.15
drive 1.1
saturation 1.0
hpf 40
volume 0.5
octave 4
noise 0
fuzz 0
spring 0
lfo_rate 0.4
lfo_shape 0.5
lfo_pitch 0
lfo_filter 0
lfo_pwm 0
